OL,3,GNEWSAUber driver cleared of murdering
OL,4,Avomiting passenger
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn Uber driver has been found not
OL,7,Fguilty of murdering a passenger who
OL,8,Fvomited in his car, but has been found
OL,9,Fguilty of causing death by dangerous
OL,10,Fdriving.
OL,12,FHayadulla Turkmani, 53, crashed into
OL,13,FMichael Ashton, 28, moments after
OL,14,Fdropping him and his partner outside
OL,15,Ftheir home in Langdon Hills, Essex.
OL,17,FThe couple had been out for dinner and
OL,18,Fdrinks together that night on 26
OL,19,FSeptember 2025, the trial at Basildon
OL,20,FCrown Court heard.
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
